);

/* Apply sine window to signal vector.                                      */
/* Window types:                                                            */
/*    1 -> sine window from 0 to pi/2                                       */
/*    2 -> sine window from pi/2 to pi                                      */
/* Every other sample is linearly interpolated, for speed.                  */
